{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>一代殿堂級巨星羅文於2002年病逝，昨日（18日）正值其離世24周年。後輩蔡一傑在社交平台上載其經典專輯封套以表懷念；生前好友陳淑芬亦分享昔日合照，並以名曲《幾許風雨》歌詞寄意，表達深切思念。</p><figure><img alt=\"（ig@djremus_choy）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188914818610892800940572.png/XtLxL4P6OvnPSeKHPOK4vSFg9pOUsNuw8Kz-ovCs_qI\"/><figcaption>（ig@djremus_choy）</figcaption></figure><p>蔡一傑曬經典專輯封套悼念</p><p>縱然時光飛逝，圈中好友及後輩依然對這位一代巨星念念不忘。草蜢成員蔡一傑特意在其個人IG上載羅文昔日經典專輯《朋友一個》的封套照片，以此表達深切懷念。他撰文直抒對前輩的敬意：「羅記，你離開我們24年了，我哋仍然好掛住你，仍然聽緊你的歌聲，你是樂壇的典範，夢中見。We miss you﹗」文中更特別附上「#羅文」及「#想念」的標籤，寄託無限思念。</p><figure><img alt=\"（ig@djremus_choy）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188914930053550080438210.png/9dh8FrXdQ4gYx4OV7Y50c0lf1lo2fMixCXfvXQl3710\"/><figcaption>（ig@djremus_choy）</figcaption></figure><p>陳淑芬分享昔日舊照</p><p>羅文生前好友兼著名經理人陳淑芬亦在IG分享了多張羅文珍貴照片，及一張二人年輕時合照。她更親自前往沙田寶福山靈位拜祭，雖未特別註明抵達時分，但從相片可見，戴上太陽眼鏡的陳淑芬細心地為羅文的靈位抹塵，而旁邊正正安放着沈殿霞及張國榮兩位已故巨星的紀念靈位。</p><p>陳淑芬在帖文中感觸留言：「今日是故友羅文離世24周年的忌辰。一路走過幾許風雨，羅文那份真誠與歌聲，從未褪色。」她更特別引用了羅文經典歌曲《幾許風雨》的歌詞寄意：「『悠然推窗觀天 雲漸散去 星再現，似你的臉 叫我溫暖 伴著我步前。』二十四年了，思念未減。」並加上「#RomanTam」、「#幾許風雨」及「#星星相識」等標籤。</p><figure><img alt=\"（ig@mrschan2000）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188915078217863168607215.jpeg/2Ab-oSIxnqnvJQFSoW1xCUe9sSeXDdqFBpjMQgaYzEI\"/><figcaption>（ig@mrschan2000）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（ig@mrschan2000）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188915076078637056289105.jpeg/Mhc4OXrVtbXJ2xP_oswnUEalTovmtWHfcNboNXDW6DU\"/><figcaption>（ig@mrschan2000）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（ig@mrschan2000）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188915073855524864907153.jpeg/p-9Tpb2VijF6CcfiS05ooRDiymCy4rY2DLk4Zgy5OGY\"/><figcaption>（ig@mrschan2000）</figcaption></figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188915071556915200512364.jpeg/lPg_PT-MdeZDUTO-cfHoqs7S9uR_QoEoZTFv1WUxb9U\"/><figure><img alt=\"（ig@mrschan2000）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188915069333803008063951.jpeg/Mna6Qbz0gEg3RdM8j-rSoyOLwN7bNLzgx7Usese1LHo\"/><figcaption>（ig@mrschan2000）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T10:59:05.114194+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":684,"images":7,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T10:45:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T11:57:37.234688+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T10:56:54.911931+00:00","content_hash":"ccfb11e0257c574640d524b7ff7afa09b72cdf3545ab0483ee3a2ed535ecab9e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}